      "result_description": "Corwen CC - 1st XI - Band1",
      "result_applied_to": "13770",
      "match_notes": "<p><strong>\ud83c\udfcf\ud83c\udfcfCorwen&nbsp;CC&nbsp;Triumphs&nbsp;in&nbsp;Season&nbsp;Opener&nbsp;Against&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Wrexham&nbsp;CC\ud83c\udfcf\ud83c\udfcf</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>After&nbsp;a&nbsp;two-week&nbsp;delay&nbsp;due&nbsp;to&nbsp;inclement&nbsp;British&nbsp;weather,&nbsp;the&nbsp;North&nbsp;Wales&nbsp;cricket&nbsp;league&nbsp;finally&nbsp;got&nbsp;under&nbsp;way&nbsp;and&nbsp;witnessed&nbsp;the&nbsp;spirited&nbsp;clash&nbsp;between&nbsp;Corwen&nbsp;CC&nbsp;and&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Wrexham&nbsp;CC&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;much-awaited&nbsp;season&nbsp;opener.&nbsp;Despite&nbsp;overnight&nbsp;rain&nbsp;threatening&nbsp;to&nbsp;dampen&nbsp;spirits,&nbsp;the&nbsp;unwavering&nbsp;dedication&nbsp;of&nbsp;head&nbsp;groundsman&nbsp;Llyr&nbsp;Jones&nbsp;and&nbsp;his&nbsp;assistant&nbsp;Carl&nbsp;Green&nbsp;ensured&nbsp;a&nbsp;playable&nbsp;pitch&nbsp;by&nbsp;noon,&nbsp;following&nbsp;a&nbsp;commendable&nbsp;effort&nbsp;to&nbsp;prepare&nbsp;the&nbsp;grounds.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Corwen&nbsp;CC,&nbsp;freshly&nbsp;promoted&nbsp;from&nbsp;Division&nbsp;3,&nbsp;faced&nbsp;off&nbsp;against&nbsp;the&nbsp;formidable&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Wrexham&nbsp;side,&nbsp;expected&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;formidable&nbsp;force&nbsp;after&nbsp;relegation&nbsp;to&nbsp;Division&nbsp;2.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With&nbsp;a&nbsp;damp&nbsp;pitch&nbsp;and&nbsp;wet&nbsp;outfield,&nbsp;both&nbsp;teams&nbsp;eyed&nbsp;a&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;advantage,&nbsp;anticipating&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;pitch&nbsp;might&nbsp;dry&nbsp;out&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;second&nbsp;innings.&nbsp;Winning&nbsp;the&nbsp;toss,&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;elected&nbsp;to&nbsp;field&nbsp;first.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Opening&nbsp;the&nbsp;batting&nbsp;for&nbsp;Corwen&nbsp;were&nbsp;club&nbsp;stalwart&nbsp;Kevin&nbsp;Sharp&nbsp;and&nbsp;last&nbsp;season&#39;s&nbsp;leading&nbsp;run-scorer,&nbsp;Harry&nbsp;Pooler.&nbsp;Harry&#39;s&nbsp;aggressive&nbsp;start&nbsp;saw&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;ball&nbsp;cut&nbsp;straight&nbsp;to&nbsp;cover,&nbsp;narrowly&nbsp;escaping&nbsp;a&nbsp;catch&nbsp;and&nbsp;racing&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;boundary&nbsp;for&nbsp;four.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;he&nbsp;fell&nbsp;victim&nbsp;to&nbsp;smart&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;by&nbsp;Phil&nbsp;Oddie&nbsp;shortly&nbsp;thereafter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;of&nbsp;new&nbsp;signing&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;injected&nbsp;fresh&nbsp;energy&nbsp;into&nbsp;Corwen&#39;s&nbsp;innings.&nbsp;With&nbsp;high&nbsp;expectations&nbsp;following&nbsp;an&nbsp;impressive&nbsp;offseason,&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;did&nbsp;not&nbsp;disappoint,&nbsp;unleashing&nbsp;a&nbsp;flurry&nbsp;of&nbsp;boundaries.&nbsp;Partnered&nbsp;by&nbsp;Kevin&nbsp;Sharp&nbsp;until&nbsp;his&nbsp;dismissal,&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;showcased&nbsp;his&nbsp;prowess&nbsp;with&nbsp;bat&nbsp;in&nbsp;hand.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tom&nbsp;King&nbsp;joined&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;crease,&nbsp;contributing&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;significant&nbsp;partnership&nbsp;before&nbsp;his&nbsp;departure.&nbsp;Although&nbsp;the&nbsp;middle&nbsp;and&nbsp;lower&nbsp;order&nbsp;struggled,&nbsp;Mark&nbsp;Wyeth&#39;s&nbsp;efforts&nbsp;stood&nbsp;out,&nbsp;adding&nbsp;crucial&nbsp;runs&nbsp;including&nbsp;a&nbsp;notable&nbsp;six.&nbsp;Rob&#39;s&nbsp;dismissal&nbsp;after&nbsp;a&nbsp;stellar&nbsp;performance,&nbsp;which&nbsp;saw&nbsp;him&nbsp;reach&nbsp;his&nbsp;first&nbsp;half&nbsp;century&nbsp;for&nbsp;Corwen,&nbsp;marked&nbsp;a&nbsp;total&nbsp;of&nbsp;110&nbsp;runs&nbsp;for&nbsp;Corwen,&nbsp;we&nbsp;felt&nbsp;this&nbsp;was&nbsp;10-20&nbsp;runs&nbsp;short&nbsp;but&nbsp;gave&nbsp;us&nbsp;something&nbsp;to&nbsp;bowl&nbsp;at.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In&nbsp;response,&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;began&nbsp;their&nbsp;innings&nbsp;aggressively,&nbsp;aiming&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;quick&nbsp;start.&nbsp;Captain&nbsp;Will&nbsp;Pooler&rsquo;s&nbsp;early&nbsp;dismissal&nbsp;of&nbsp;Gareth&nbsp;Evans&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;over&nbsp;set&nbsp;the&nbsp;tone,&nbsp;bolstering&nbsp;Corwen&#39;s&nbsp;confidence.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sam&nbsp;Shoemark&nbsp;and&nbsp;George&nbsp;Forgrave&nbsp;countered&nbsp;with&nbsp;quality&nbsp;strokes,&nbsp;but&nbsp;a&nbsp;pivotal&nbsp;moment&nbsp;arrived&nbsp;with&nbsp;Danny&nbsp;Jones&#39;&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;fielding,&nbsp;executing&nbsp;a&nbsp;direct-hit&nbsp;run-out,&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;boundary,&nbsp;that&nbsp;shifted&nbsp;momentum&nbsp;in&nbsp;Corwen&#39;s&nbsp;favor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Simon&nbsp;Harrison&rsquo;s&nbsp;tight&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;further&nbsp;intensified&nbsp;the&nbsp;pressure,&nbsp;culminating&nbsp;in&nbsp;crucial&nbsp;wickets&nbsp;including&nbsp;the&nbsp;dismissal&nbsp;of&nbsp;Sam&nbsp;Shoemark&nbsp;caught&nbsp;at&nbsp;slip&nbsp;by&nbsp;Harry&nbsp;Pooler.&nbsp;Corwen&#39;s&nbsp;strategic&nbsp;use&nbsp;of&nbsp;six&nbsp;bowlers&nbsp;kept&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;on&nbsp;their&nbsp;toes,&nbsp;with&nbsp;notable&nbsp;performances&nbsp;from&nbsp;debutant&nbsp;Mayurkumar&nbsp;Paladiya&nbsp;and&nbsp;seasoned&nbsp;players&nbsp;like&nbsp;Simon&nbsp;Harrison&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;Storey,&nbsp;whose&nbsp;swing&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;secured&nbsp;three&nbsp;crucial&nbsp;wickets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With&nbsp;Marchwiel&nbsp;requiring&nbsp;less&nbsp;than&nbsp;20&nbsp;runs&nbsp;for&nbsp;victory,&nbsp;the&nbsp;match&nbsp;intensified.&nbsp;However,&nbsp;the&nbsp;introduction&nbsp;of&nbsp;another&nbsp;new&nbsp;signing&nbsp;Steffan&nbsp;Lloyd&rsquo;s&nbsp;bowling&nbsp;proved&nbsp;decisive,&nbsp;as&nbsp;he&nbsp;dismantled&nbsp;the&nbsp;stumps&nbsp;to&nbsp;secure&nbsp;the&nbsp;final&nbsp;wickets&nbsp;needed&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;thrilling&nbsp;victory.&nbsp;Corwen&nbsp;CC&#39;s&nbsp;determined&nbsp;fight&nbsp;until&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&nbsp;was&nbsp;evident,&nbsp;showcasing&nbsp;their&nbsp;resilience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Man&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Match&nbsp;honors&nbsp;rightfully&nbsp;went&nbsp;to&nbsp;Rob&nbsp;Storey&nbsp;for&nbsp;his&nbsp;standout&nbsp;performance&nbsp;with&nbsp;both&nbsp;bat&nbsp;and&nbsp;ball.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Full&nbsp;match&nbsp;stats&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;found&nbsp;at&nbsp;https://corwen.play-cricket.com/website/results/6251158&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The&nbsp;team&nbsp;now&nbsp;sets&nbsp;its&nbsp;sights&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;upcoming&nbsp;fixture&nbsp;against&nbsp;Llanwrst,&nbsp;buoyed&nbsp;by&nbsp;this&nbsp;hard-fought&nbsp;victory&nbsp;and&nbsp;aiming&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;momentum&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;season&nbsp;ahead.</p>\r\n",
